description.narrative:
The overall objective of the intervention is To strengthen and advance human rights defenders and organisations processes related to land and environmental protection, the right to a life in peace and the eradication of gender-based violence, impunity and the militarization of civil life, in Colombia.

For achieving this goal, four specific outcomes have been drawn up:

1. Accompanied Human Rights defenders perceive their security, legitimacy and scope of action has broaden, allowing them to organise and foster peace, justice and the construction of a non-violent society processes;
2. Human Rights defenders who participate in security and protection capacity building trainings, have increased their knowledge for timely and sound follow-up and assessments as well as defining proper digital security procedures;
3. Duty bearers listen to human rights defenders demands and timely react to threats and potential risks to ensure defenders' security;
4. Duty bearers have updated and detailed information on human rights defenders situation to provide relevant and timely protection measures, including public statements reinforcing the rights to free expression and association.
